<p class="lead">Published in 2000 by Australian Scholarly Publishing, 'The People's Ground: The MCG' is a revised and updated edition of Dunstan's first book, <a href="{{ '/the-paddock-that-grew' | url }}">The Paddock That Grew</a> (1962).</p>
