    <h2 class="h4">About the book</h2>
    <p>Nearly forty years after his first book told the story of the Melbourne Cricket Ground's growth from swampy paddock to national sporting arena, Dunstan revised and updated the history as 'The People's Ground', bringing the story of the M.C.G. into the modern era.</p>
    <p>Published by Australian Scholarly Publishing, 2000. ISBN 1-875606-78-5.</p>
